{
	"title": "Espace : calculer un produit scalaire",
	"description": "Produit scalaire en repère orthonormé (coordonnées, AB·AC) et par polarisation (pièges : z oublié, OB·OC, division par 2 oubliée)",
	"grades": ["T_SPE"],
	"points": ["TSPE-068", "TSPE-070", "TSPE-071", "TSPE-073"],
	"theme": "Géométrie",
	"domain": "Orthogonalité et distances dans l'espace",
	"subdomain": "Produit scalaire",
	"level": 1,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 90,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"acceptDecimal": true
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Dans l'espace muni d'un repère orthonormé, on considère les vecteurs $\\vec{u}\\begin{pmatrix}{{u1}}\\\\{{u2}}\\\\{{u3}}\\end{pmatrix}$ et $\\vec{v}\\begin{pmatrix}{{v1}}\\\\{{v2}}\\\\{{v3}}\\end{pmatrix}$.\n\nCalcule $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}$.\n\n$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "u1",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "u2",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "u3",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "v1",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "v2",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				},
				{
					"name": "v3",
					"expression": "-6..6"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["u3 != 0", "v3 != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:u1*v1+u2*v2+u3*v3}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Dans un repère orthonormé, $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=xx'+yy'+zz'$.",
					"$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{u1}}\\times{{v1;()}}+{{u2;()}}\\times{{v2;()}}+{{u3;()}}\\times{{v3;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:u1*v1+u2*v2+u3*v3}} }$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Dans l'espace muni d'un repère orthonormé, on considère les points $A({{ax}}\\,;\\,{{ay}}\\,;\\,{{az}})$, $B({{bx}}\\,;\\,{{by}}\\,;\\,{{bz}})$ et $C({{cx}}\\,;\\,{{cy}}\\,;\\,{{cz}})$.\n\nCalcule $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}$.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "ax",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "ay",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "az",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "bx",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "by",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "bz",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "cx",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "cy",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "cz",
					"expression": "-5..5"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"abs(bx-ax)+abs(by-ay)+abs(bz-az) > 0",
				"abs(cx-ax)+abs(cy-ay)+abs(cz-az) > 0",
				"az != 0"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(bx-ax)*(cx-ax)+(by-ay)*(cy-ay)+(bz-az)*(cz-az)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\begin{pmatrix}{{eval:bx-ax}}\\\\{{eval:by-ay}}\\\\{{eval:bz-az}}\\end{pmatrix}$ et $\\overrightarrow{AC}\\begin{pmatrix}{{eval:cx-ax}}\\\\{{eval:cy-ay}}\\\\{{eval:cz-az}}\\end{pmatrix}$.",
					"$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}={{eval:bx-ax}}\\times{{eval:cx-ax;()}}+{{eval:by-ay;()}}\\times{{eval:cy-ay;()}}+{{eval:bz-az;()}}\\times{{eval:cz-az;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:(bx-ax)*(cx-ax)+(by-ay)*(cy-ay)+(bz-az)*(cz-az)}} }$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Dans l'espace, $\\vec{u}$ et $\\vec{v}$ sont deux vecteurs tels que $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|={{c}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}$.\n\n$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "2..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "2..12"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["c < a+b", "c > abs(a-b)", "c*c != a*a+b*b"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(c^2-a^2-b^2)/2}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2+2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$, donc $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2-\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2-\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2\\right)$.",
					"$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left({{c}}^2-{{a}}^2-{{b}}^2\\right)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:(c^2-a^2-b^2)/2}} }$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
